	"data": "Triple Extraction — Batch 1 (Priority Concepts)\n\nBottom-up vocabulary induction from 6 high-value concept notes, following the AutoSchemaKG approach: extract triples first, let the predicate vocabulary emerge from the data.\n\nMethod\n\nExtracted typed subject-predicate-object triples from 6 vault concept notes. Each triple includes the note source, the relationship type, and a supporting quote. Predicates were NOT predefined — they emerged from what the text actually says.\n\nNotes…",
